OL,5,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FDealing with drug users and
OL,7,     Fdealers is a daily challenge for
OL,8,     Fcops. A driver, suspected of being
OL,9,     Funder the influence of drugs,
OL,10,     Ftries to evade capture, including
OL,11,     Framming a police car.
OL,12,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FIt's estimated that 1,000 vans are
OL,14,     Fstolen in the UK every month. In
OL,15,     Fthis episode Derbyshire cops
OL,16,     Ftarget criminals stealing vans,
OL,17,     Fbanned drivers in vans and thieves
OL,18,     Fin vans on the run.
