OL,12,G0125 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,13,G     Speeders
OL,14,     FOn the night shift, PCs see a
OL,15,     Fdriver with his foot down in a
OL,16,     Ftop-of-the-range vehicle. And
OL,17,     Fafter spotting some cops, a man
OL,18,     Fditches his wheels to make off on
